This project builds on the following MIT-licensed work:

wotblitz-replay-analyzer (BlitzScrim) — BPR 2.0 formula, feature set and
the original tank list.
  Copyright (c) 2026 roklimovich
  https://github.com/roklimovich/wotblitz-replay-analyzer

wotbreplay-parser — .wotbreplay format and battle-results field numbers,
re-implemented here in TypeScript; test replays in test/fixtures.
  Copyright (c) Pavel Perestoronin (eigenein)
  https://github.com/eigenein/wotbreplay-parser

blitz-stat-tracker — 2026 test replay (test/fixtures/scrim_2026.wotbreplay).
  Copyright (c) nickz973
  https://github.com/nickz973/blitz-stat-tracker

blitz-tools — historical tank list.
  Copyright (c) Jylpah
  https://github.com/Jylpah/blitz-tools

